            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 2767,
                "endIndex": 2999,
                "text": "**Deferred Payment / Legal Funding:** For qualifying property settlement matters, they accept payment upon final property division or partner with family law funders (e.g., JustFund) so you don't pay out-of-pocket during proceedings"
