                20,
                7
              ]
            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 3930,
                "endIndex": 4036,
                "text": "Comprehensive, in-depth legal advice sessions (1 hour+) often carry a capped fixed fee (e.g., $250–$550)"
