            },
            {
              "segment": {
                "startIndex": 4488,
                "endIndex": 4704,
                "text": "However, for **property division**, firms can offer an internal **Deferred Fee Agreement** or integrate with services like **JustFund**, where legal fees are paid out of the proceeds of the house sale or asset payout"
